<title>USA: MicroTouch to revise 95, 96 results.</title>
<headline>MicroTouch to revise 95, 96 results.</headline>
<dateline>METHUEN, Mass. 1996-12-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>MicroTouch Systems Inc said on Friday it would restate its financial statements for 1995 and the first three quarters of 1996.</p>
<p>The company said the revision is a result of a change in the accounting treatment of arbitration costs incurred in an international arbitration case with its former Japanese distributor, Nissha Printing Co Ltd.</p>
